WEBVTT

00:00:01.315 --> 00:00:13.159
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:18.899
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:25.805
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:37.342
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.551 --> 00:00:43.490
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:50.896
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:58.661
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.705 --> 00:01:05.579
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.579 --> 00:01:11.142
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:17.424
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.424 --> 00:01:25.889
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:03:03.096 --> 00:03:05.298
This is...

00:03:05.298 --> 00:03:07.732
The Interval.

00:03:13.607 --> 00:03:15.734
Helga!

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.878
Helga!

00:03:19.145 --> 00:03:21.014
Helga!

00:03:21.014 --> 00:03:23.039
Helga!

00:03:25.752 --> 00:03:30.712
THE END, AND THEN THE BEGINNING

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.037
Helga!

00:04:00.787 --> 00:04:01.755
Helga.

00:04:01.755 --> 00:04:03.523
Helga!

00:04:03.523 --> 00:04:05.592
Wake up! Helga!

00:04:05.592 --> 00:04:08.254
Helga! Helga!

00:04:10.764 --> 00:04:12.391
Helga.

00:04:15.368 --> 00:04:17.598
Are you okay, Helga?

00:04:19.573 --> 00:04:21.700
Thoma.

00:04:22.142 --> 00:04:24.303
Thank goodness.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:42.487
Thoma!

00:04:51.237 --> 00:04:52.727
Thoma!

00:04:55.241 --> 00:04:57.505
T-Thoma!

00:05:11.524 --> 00:05:13.116
Tina.

00:05:17.163 --> 00:05:20.621
Se... th...

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:32.371
Seth...

00:05:32.846 --> 00:05:35.679
Thoma... How did this?!

00:05:36.683 --> 00:05:40.278
Tina, please forgive me.

00:05:40.487 --> 00:05:42.921
Please forgive me.

00:05:44.524 --> 00:05:47.394
The one who killed Soran...

00:05:47.394 --> 00:05:49.225
was me.

00:05:51.064 --> 00:05:52.766
Seth!

00:05:52.766 --> 00:05:54.324
Tina.

00:05:55.201 --> 00:05:57.965
I killed Soran.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.003
Seth.

00:06:02.275 --> 00:06:05.979
I can't believe such a thing.

00:06:05.979 --> 00:06:07.947
It's the truth.

00:06:07.947 --> 00:06:09.539
Tina.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:12.944
It's what really happened.

00:06:19.893 --> 00:06:21.656
Seth.

00:06:29.302 --> 00:06:34.137
I've been suffering inside of
Thoma all this time.

00:06:35.775 --> 00:06:38.266
I couldn't completely become Thoma.

00:06:39.846 --> 00:06:44.340
I wanted to apologize
to you, Tina.

00:06:44.617 --> 00:06:47.415
I wanted to apologize to you.

00:06:47.987 --> 00:06:50.353
Seth.

00:07:08.908 --> 00:07:11.433
You can't stay here.

00:07:12.779 --> 00:07:14.906
You have to go back, Tina.

00:07:28.661 --> 00:07:32.392
Please live, Tina!
You have to live!

00:07:32.532 --> 00:07:34.796
Seth!

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:50.049
You have to focus your
thoughts on living, Tina!

00:07:50.049 --> 00:07:51.448
Seth!

00:07:51.951 --> 00:07:53.787
Go back! Tina!

00:07:53.787 --> 00:07:55.550
Hurry!

00:07:57.157 --> 00:07:59.250
Seth!

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.701
Helga!

00:08:08.701 --> 00:08:10.464
Thoma!

00:08:16.943 --> 00:08:19.912
Tina! You mustn't!
You mustn't come here!

00:08:21.481 --> 00:08:22.749
Tina!

00:08:22.749 --> 00:08:24.250
Seth!

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:29.187
You are Thoma!
If you die, Thoma will die!

00:08:32.492 --> 00:08:35.929
Right now, Thoma is
the one who's alive!

00:08:35.929 --> 00:08:39.831
I beg of you Seth,
become Thoma and live!

00:08:42.468 --> 00:08:47.140
I am Thoma.
My sins are Thoma's sins.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:51.736
That's why I must die to atone for
what I did to you and Soran.

00:08:51.945 --> 00:08:54.846
I have no desire to be
reborn and live.

00:08:55.782 --> 00:08:57.977
Seth.

00:09:06.926 --> 00:09:08.428
Seth.

00:09:08.428 --> 00:09:11.130
Even if you die,
it won't be an atonement.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:15.226
Live your life as Thoma and make
the people around you happy.

00:09:15.335 --> 00:09:18.896
That would be a true atonement.

00:09:25.745 --> 00:09:29.415
Tina, hurry and go back.

00:09:29.415 --> 00:09:34.216
The Zone is close.
If you don't hurry, you'll die!

00:09:40.827 --> 00:09:47.062
Seth... I've hurt you
so, so much, haven't I?

00:09:50.236 --> 00:09:53.640
Seth, you always protected me.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:56.509
You even forgave me for
what happened with Soran.

00:09:56.509 --> 00:10:00.605
That is the real Seth.
The gentle Seth.

00:10:05.618 --> 00:10:09.918
If you say you're going to die,
then I will die as well!

00:10:33.947 --> 00:10:35.710
Tina!

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:38.551
Tina!

00:10:38.551 --> 00:10:42.021
You would... for my sake...

00:10:42.021 --> 00:10:44.854
For my sake...

00:10:46.125 --> 00:10:47.956
Tina...

00:10:50.763 --> 00:10:52.424
Tina!

00:10:58.171 --> 00:10:59.572
Tina!

00:10:59.572 --> 00:11:01.540
Tina!

00:11:02.241 --> 00:11:04.277
Tina, I didn't...

00:11:04.277 --> 00:11:07.747
I didn't mean for this to happen!

00:11:07.747 --> 00:11:10.116
I'm going to cause you
unhappiness again!

00:11:10.116 --> 00:11:12.485
You can't die! You can't!

00:11:12.485 --> 00:11:15.521
You can't die!
Tina! Tina!

00:11:15.521 --> 00:11:17.991
You can't die! Helga!

00:11:17.991 --> 00:11:20.593
Helga! Wake up! Helga!

00:11:20.593 --> 00:11:22.228
You can't die!

00:11:22.228 --> 00:11:25.598
Helga! You'll come back with me!
We'll go back!

00:11:25.598 --> 00:11:28.192
Live! Helga!

00:11:35.108 --> 00:11:37.076
Thoma.

00:11:38.644 --> 00:11:40.771
Helga.

00:11:45.618 --> 00:11:48.321
I will live my life as Thoma.

00:11:48.321 --> 00:11:49.789
Helga.

00:11:49.789 --> 00:11:52.417
Yes, Thoma!

00:11:52.792 --> 00:11:56.387
Let's live, Helga!
We're going to live!

00:11:57.096 --> 00:11:59.530
Yes!

00:12:05.772 --> 00:12:07.774
I'm going to live.

00:12:07.774 --> 00:12:10.176
On Earth, just like Helga.

00:12:10.176 --> 00:12:12.278
In the same era.

00:12:12.278 --> 00:12:14.405
In the same time.

00:12:26.492 --> 00:12:28.255
Soreto.

00:12:29.862 --> 00:12:31.497
Helga!

00:12:31.497 --> 00:12:33.132
Don't do that! You shouldn't
get up so suddenly!

00:12:33.132 --> 00:12:34.500
Where's Helga?!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.403
Don't worry, everything's okay now.

00:12:37.403 --> 00:12:40.006
She hasn't regained
consciousness yet,

00:12:40.006 --> 00:12:42.175
but Chitto has been with her
the whole time.

00:12:42.175 --> 00:12:44.166
Really?

00:12:45.044 --> 00:12:47.246
Thank goodness.

00:12:47.246 --> 00:12:49.544
So we made it back from the Interval.

00:12:51.851 --> 00:12:54.253
Were you here the whole time?

00:12:54.253 --> 00:12:56.084
Yes.

00:12:58.391 --> 00:13:00.293
What's the matter?

00:13:00.293 --> 00:13:02.929
So you were Lord Seth, right?

00:13:02.929 --> 00:13:05.989
You were always by Princess Tina's
side protecting her, right?

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.795
Soreto.

00:13:09.602 --> 00:13:12.264
Helga has regained
consciousness, Thoma!

00:13:13.439 --> 00:13:15.041
Helga!

00:13:15.041 --> 00:13:16.809
Thoma!

00:13:16.809 --> 00:13:19.004
Is it all right for you
to be up?

00:13:19.479 --> 00:13:21.208
Yes.

00:13:22.148 --> 00:13:24.207
Thank you, Thoma.

00:13:29.856 --> 00:13:33.126
Look, Helga, your bag was outside.

00:13:33.126 --> 00:13:34.923
Here!

00:13:39.866 --> 00:13:41.701
Dumas.

00:13:41.701 --> 00:13:45.102
Dumas is the one who
turned off the device.

00:14:06.359 --> 00:14:09.021
W-What is he going to do?!

00:14:25.111 --> 00:14:27.480
The two of them are okay now.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.380
Really?

00:14:30.116 --> 00:14:31.879
That's good.

00:14:32.051 --> 00:14:34.781
Dumas is going to destroy
the transference device.

00:15:06.586 --> 00:15:07.853
Mel.

00:15:07.853 --> 00:15:09.844
Are you awake?
Mel!

00:15:10.656 --> 00:15:12.988
Everyone...

00:15:13.726 --> 00:15:15.887
I'm sorry.

00:15:16.295 --> 00:15:20.197
It was because of all the
selfish things I did.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.835
It's all right now, Mel.

00:15:22.835 --> 00:15:25.404
This is Palza's record.

00:15:25.404 --> 00:15:27.395
You keep it, Mel.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:44.785
With this, our responsibility
has been fulfilled.

00:15:51.097 --> 00:15:52.865
What are we going to do now?

00:15:52.865 --> 00:15:54.500
Dumas said that,

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:58.436
if we wanted to return to our original
bodies, he'd send a ship back to Greecia.

00:16:00.239 --> 00:16:02.867
I think I'm going to stay on earth.

00:16:05.011 --> 00:16:07.946
I was thinking that's what
I want to do, too.

00:16:09.515 --> 00:16:11.483
I thought you'd say that.

00:16:11.951 --> 00:16:15.512
This time, my twenty-first lifetime,

00:16:15.721 --> 00:16:18.491
I'm going to live the lifetime
I've been given.

00:16:18.491 --> 00:16:21.358
-What about you, Tarlant?
-Isn't it obvious?

00:16:22.628 --> 00:16:24.397
Hesma.

00:16:24.397 --> 00:16:27.230
He was the one who wanted to
get back home the most.

00:16:30.069 --> 00:16:33.973
What will happen to Helga and
Thoma's memories of their past lives?

00:16:33.973 --> 00:16:37.943
Most likely, they'll disappear
completely once they turn twelve,

00:16:37.943 --> 00:16:39.945
the same way we do.

00:16:39.945 --> 00:16:43.745
Gherta's memories are also something
temporary that will disappear soon.

00:16:43.949 --> 00:16:45.551
It's the same for us.

00:16:45.551 --> 00:16:50.989
And we, too, will soon forget all about
Greecia and all about ourselves, right?

00:16:53.859 --> 00:16:56.487
Do you think we'll ever meet again?

00:16:58.264 --> 00:17:00.357
I'm sure we will.

00:17:03.669 --> 00:17:08.163
The clouds traveling in
the blue sky above me,

00:17:08.574 --> 00:17:12.772
are telling me to
return to my homeland.

00:17:13.412 --> 00:17:15.880
To my homeland,

00:17:16.816 --> 00:17:20.149
to a place I don't even know
the name of, far, far away

00:17:22.254 --> 00:17:24.245
Oh, homeland.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:28.260
Your beautiful, blue coastline,

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:31.161
in the end, will I never have
the chance to see it?

00:17:33.499 --> 00:17:36.832
But, just the same,

00:17:37.136 --> 00:17:39.605
close by this southern country,

00:17:39.605 --> 00:17:41.974
in a place that can be
reached by foot,

00:17:41.974 --> 00:17:45.277
your shore is unmistakably there,

00:17:45.277 --> 00:17:47.643
it seems to me.

00:18:05.164 --> 00:18:07.064
Big Sister.

00:18:07.333 --> 00:18:10.530
I'm giving this garden to you.

00:18:11.871 --> 00:18:15.739
With this, the time around you
will start flowing again.

00:18:17.076 --> 00:18:20.807
This place will belong
to you alone, forever.

00:18:23.382 --> 00:18:27.944
And as of today, I will
stop the time of my heart.

00:18:29.789 --> 00:18:31.381
Forever.

00:18:33.025 --> 00:18:36.228
Thoma! Aghi and the others
are nowhere to be found!

00:18:36.228 --> 00:18:37.889
Aghi and the others?

00:18:38.631 --> 00:18:40.496
Aghi...

00:18:43.002 --> 00:18:46.172
Chitto, let's go back
to the orphanage.

00:18:46.172 --> 00:18:50.871
Back to the orphanage?
But you'll get picked on again, Helga!

00:18:52.545 --> 00:18:54.547
I'll be okay now.

00:18:54.547 --> 00:18:58.717
There are so many things that
I have inside of my heart.

00:18:58.717 --> 00:19:01.880
I have to live my life with
determination, right, Chitto?

00:19:02.221 --> 00:19:03.882
Helga.

00:19:06.692 --> 00:19:09.126
I'm sure you're going
to meet Soran.

00:19:12.364 --> 00:19:16.869
Meeting me, meeting Seth
is the proof of that.

00:19:16.869 --> 00:19:20.635
I'm sure he'll come to you.
That's the kind of guy he is.

00:19:40.359 --> 00:19:41.894
Thoma!

00:19:41.894 --> 00:19:44.385
Chitto! Helga!

00:20:14.827 --> 00:20:20.265
TEN YEARS LATER

00:20:35.114 --> 00:20:38.083
Teacher! Miss Helga!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.184
What is it?

00:20:40.519 --> 00:20:42.282
Over there!

00:20:52.831 --> 00:20:55.857
Could I please have
a glass of water?

00:21:10.583 --> 00:21:13.211
You drew this picture, right?

00:21:13.552 --> 00:21:17.613
Yes, that's a picture I drew
when I was eleven years old.

00:21:21.894 --> 00:21:24.385
How did you know it was
a picture drawn by me?

00:21:28.334 --> 00:21:30.768
I just kind of had
a feeling that it was.

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:33.072
Here you go.

00:21:33.072 --> 00:21:35.063
Thank you.

00:21:39.445 --> 00:21:41.814
This thing, right?

00:21:41.814 --> 00:21:44.874
It's a birthmark I've
had all my life.

00:21:49.355 --> 00:21:51.448
Ti... na...

00:21:51.824 --> 00:21:56.158
I'm so sorry!
What am I doing?

00:22:11.443 --> 00:22:22.445
Opposite grief, gentleness awaits

00:22:22.521 --> 00:22:36.026
The miracle of our encounter
makes our life shine

00:22:38.704 --> 00:22:44.109
Yes, you're not alone

00:22:44.109 --> 00:22:50.514
Bounded to you...

00:22:50.783 --> 00:22:56.555
Overcoming the distance of time

00:22:56.555 --> 00:23:02.528
Continuing to believe

00:23:02.528 --> 00:23:10.731
You will move towards your origin
